                                        <p>Typical outcomes at 12 months: 8-20% OEE improvement, 20-40% scrap reduction, 10-25% labor productivity gain, 5-12% energy reduction. Payback in 12-24 months for well-scoped projects.</p>
                                        <h3>Should I buy SAP DMC or build custom MES?</h3>
